 "remarks": "Historic character meets modern loft living in the heart of Norwalk's vibrant Wall Street neighborhood! This beautifully renovated 2-bedroom apartment delivers a unique urban feel with soaring 10+ foot ceilings, original exposed brick walls, oversized windows and hardwood floors throughout. The sleek modern kitchen features quartz countertops, stylish cabinetry, stainless steel appliances and a breakfast bar opening to the bright and airy living space. One of the true highlights is the large private deck, exclusive to this unit, a rare find and the perfect spot for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing. Two bedrooms offer great closet space, while the beautifully finished full bath features a glass-enclosed tiled shower and exposed brick detail. In unit laundry and efficient heating and cooling add everyday comfort and convenience. One off-street parking space is included. Located just steps from the restaurants, shops and energy of the revitalized Wall Street neighborhood, with convenient access to Metro-North, I-95 and the Merritt Parkway. All the character and style of an NYC loft, with the space, private outdoor living and convenience of Norwalk! Rental amount shown is effective rent based on a 13 month lease with one month free.",
